    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d82">

                <pb facs="0246" n="150" xml:id="pg150"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Baron Riedl.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-11-21"><hi rendition="#italic">November 21,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I have received your note of November
                    18, inclosing brochure in the matter of the claim for indemnity by the
                    Austro-Hungarian Government for the shooting of certain of its subjects at
                    Lattimer, Pa., for which I desire to thank you. The matter will receive my early
                    attention.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">David J. Hill</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
